Z||000000||bHooper||05-21-2001||04:58 AM||||Debra Norville was working at Burger King, and <B>all[b/] they had was hamburger's (i don't eat fast food hamburger's), and she kept being snippy to me!<P>when i would ask for a plain fish sandwich; "[b]NO</B> all we have are hamburger's with lettuce, lots of mayo (the world would be a better place without this stuff!), pickle's on a sesame sead bun!"<P>so i said ok, how about a chicken sandwich?  again she said; "<B>NO</B> all we have are hamburger's with lettuce, lots of mayo, pickle's on a sesame sead bun!"<P>now i was getting angry and flustered, so i asked if i could have a large french fry? "<B>NO I told you twice already</B> that all we have are hamburger's with lettuce, lots of mayo, pickle's on a sesame sead bun!"<P>uugggg!  ok, So let me ask you this, Debra... can i have an order of onion rings and a strawberry shake to go?<P>Debra:  "Yes, that will be $3.48 with tax."<P><BR>at that point i decided it was time to get out of bed, even if it was an hour early!<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT||||reg||1
